<title>CANADA: Rayrock may sell U.S. fertilizer unit.</title>
<headline>Rayrock may sell U.S. fertilizer unit.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rayrock Yellowknife Resources Inc said it is in talks to sell its fertilizer operations in Carlsbad, New Mexico.</p>
<p>Rayrock said no definite agreement has been made to date and any agreement would be subject to regulatory approvals in the United States.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
